{{!--
  Rendered above mdBook's own menu bar on every page. mdBook merges a theme
  directory with its defaults, so this is the whole override: index.hbs is not
  forked and nothing here has to be re-reconciled on an mdBook upgrade.

  It exists because docs.zorp.dev is a different origin with a different
  generator, and a reader who followed the Docs link off zorp.dev had no link
  back. The site's own header stops at the origin boundary; this is the half
  that carries across it. Absolute URLs for the same reason.
--}}
<div class="zorp-sitebar">
  {{!-- The wordmark is the way home, which is where it is on zorp.dev too.
        The label spells that out, because "zorp" alone does not. --}}
  <a class="zorp-sitebar-brand" href="https://zorp.dev/" aria-label="zorp.dev, the main site">zorp</a>
  <nav class="zorp-sitebar-nav" aria-label="zorp.dev">
    <a href="https://zorp.dev/research/">Research</a>
    <a href="https://zorp.dev/blogs/">Blogs</a>
    <a href="https://github.com/aviskaar/zorp">GitHub</a>
  </nav>
</div>
